WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.303
See each rep, seconds later.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:06.714
Watch each rep a few seconds after you lift it. Nothing is recorded.

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:13.111
Choose three, five, eight or ten seconds. The header shows how far behind you are.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:18.722
Prop the phone up and lift. Then turn round and watch the rep. No tapping.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:22.511
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
